<h1>Construct_Line_Entity</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Creates new datum line by a construction line reducible entity.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Name</b></i></span> – name of the resulting datum line that will be created.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Entity</b></i></span> – name of the construction line reducible entity. Could have entity of one of the following types:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Line – uses the line itself.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Cylinder – uses its axis.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Cone – uses its axis.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Rectangular slot – in this case uses one of its sides. <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>LineIndex</i></span> is used to determine the side.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Round slot – uses its axis, i.e. the full length of the slot.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>LineIndex</b></i></span> – used only if the entity in <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Entity</i></span> parameter is rectangular slot. The values are 1, 2, 3, or 4, which means the side of the slot. In all other cases this parameter is ignored. Default value is 0.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span><i style="font-style:italic;">Datuming &gt; Line (Interactive line definition</i> <span style="font-style:normal;">method</span><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>)</i></span></span> from the main menu or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Datuming &gt; Non-interactive &gt; Line (Cylinder (from list)</i></span> tab<span style="font-style:italic;"><i>)</i></span> from the main menu.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Construct_Line_Entity( Name="Line 1", Entity="Cylinder 1", LineIndex=0 )</p>
